%% Omni-vite — Sequence: Sign-up & Onboarding
sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Prospective Student
  participant W as Web App
  participant API as Auth API
  participant DB as Database

  S->>W: Enter name, email, password
  W->>API: POST /signup
  API->>API: Validate email ends in .edu
  alt invalid domain
    API-->>W: 400 — .edu email required
    W-->>S: Show inline error
  else valid domain
    API->>DB: Create User
    DB-->>API: User created
    API-->>W: 201 + session token
    W-->>S: Prompt for college + preferences
    S->>W: Select college, describe ideal events, pick categories
    W->>API: PATCH /users/:id/preferences
    API->>DB: Save college, preferenceDescription, categories
    DB-->>API: OK
    API-->>W: 200
    W-->>S: Enter dashboard, pre-filtered by categories
  end
